'''Nooma''' was a [[Gender|female]]<ref name="SC 101" /> [[Myykian]]<ref name="Lovitt:2025" /> who worked as an [[analyst]]<ref name="SC 104">{{SkeletonCrew|Can't Say I Remember No At Attin}}</ref> on the isolated [[planet]] of [[At Attin]],<ref name="SC 101" /> accommodating an [[Galactic Republic|Old Republic]] [[Galactic Credit Standard|credit]] [[At Attin Mint|mint]].<ref name="SC 108">{{SkeletonCrew|The Real Good Guys}}</ref> She was the wife of [[Nol]] and the [[Parent|mother]] of [[Neel]], [[Tuloo]], and the twins [[Jobo]] and [[Jorko]].<ref name="Nooma" /> Around [[9 ABY]],<ref name="SCDate">{{SkeletonCrewDate}}</ref> when Neel accidentally left the planet alongside a few other [[youngling]]s aboard a [[starship]] found in the [[Forest|woods]],<ref name="SC 101" /> Nooma and the other children's parents took steps to enable the boy to return to At Attin.<ref name="SC 107">{{SkeletonCrew|We're Gonna Be In So Much Trouble}}</ref>

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Nooma first appeared in "[[This Could Be a Real Adventure]]" the first episode of the live-action [[Disney+]] series ''[[Star Wars: Skeleton Crew]]'',<ref name="SC 101" /> which aired on [[December 2]], [[2024]].<ref name="Early">{{SW|url=news/skeleton-crew-premiere-date|text=''Star Wars: Skeleton Crew'' Will Debut Early|date=2024-11-26}}</ref>

